      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "On due consideration of the proviso to Section 76 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006,\nreasons assigned in the application so also the affidavit of learned counsel for the appellants filed along with the application, we are of the considered view that the cause shown by the appellants is sufficient to condone the delay of 42 days.",
